      "content": "that's actually really scary to hear. if they're using concentrated VOCs like that, it makes sense why i've been feeling so off. i'm starting to wonder if they're doing this on purpose or if it's just a side effect of their setup, but the timing is just too perfect. do you have any advice on how i can test my indoor air quality to see if these specific compounds are actually getting inside my house? i need to know for sure what i'm being exposed to.",
